
<!-- 3. Type -->
<section class="ss-sec" id="type" aria-labelledby="h-type">
  <header class="pm-section-head pm-section-head--page ss-head"><h2 id="h-type">Type</h2><span class="pm-meta">SPEC B.4</span></header>
  <div class="ss-body">
    <p class="ss-lede">One text family carries everything: <strong>Schibsted Grotesk</strong>, a newspaper grotesk drawn for small sizes and long columns. <span class="pm-mono">JetBrains Mono</span> is only for ids, digests, repo paths, log lines and code. Seven named steps, every line height a multiple of 4.</p>
    <div class="ss-card">
      <div class="ss-spec"><p class="ss-spec-name"><strong>Digits</strong>28 / 32, weight 600, tabular</p><p class="pm-row" style="gap:var(--pm-space-7)"><span class="pm-t-digits">3<span class="pm-t-body pm-muted"> / </span>3</span><span class="pm-t-digits">1<span class="pm-t-body pm-muted"> / </span>4</span><span class="pm-t-digits">18<span class="pm-t-body pm-muted"> %</span></span></p></div>
      <div class="ss-spec"><p class="ss-spec-name"><strong>Title</strong>22 / 28, weight 600</p><p class="pm-t-title">Your private checklist</p></div>
      <div class="ss-spec"><p class="ss-spec-name"><strong>Heading</strong>17 / 24, weight 600</p><p class="pm-t-heading">Fresh checks every day</p></div>
      <div class="ss-spec"><p class="ss-spec-name"><strong>Reading</strong>17 / 28, weight 400, 68ch</p><p class="pm-t-reading pm-measure">Sign up, log in, land on your own empty checklist, and add your own tasks to it, each one going to the bottom of the list.</p></div>
      <div class="ss-spec"><p class="ss-spec-name"><strong>Body</strong>15 / 22, weight 400 (14 / 20 compact)</p><p class="pm-t-body">Pramaan is building sprint 1 of 4 (building). Nothing needed from you.</p></div>
      <div class="ss-spec"><p class="ss-spec-name"><strong>Label</strong>14 / 16, weight 500</p><p class="pm-t-label">Approve the plan and start building</p></div>
      <div class="ss-spec"><p class="ss-spec-name"><strong>Meta</strong>12 / 16, weight 400, tracking 0.01em</p><p class="pm-t-meta">3 of 3 documents accepted · Updated 22 minutes ago</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ss-grid3">
      <div class="ss-card"><h3>Tabular numerals, columns only</h3><p class="ss-cap">Tabular figures widen commas and colons, so they only go where digits line up in a column.</p>
        <div class="ss-tnum-col pm-t-meta pm-tnum" aria-label="A log time column"><span>14:10:02</span><span>14:10:11</span><span>14:12:48</span></div>
        <p class="pm-t-body">Prose stays proportional: 5,415,812 of 20,000,000 tokens this month, reset 1 October at 14:10.</p></div>
      <div class="ss-card"><h3>Mono rules</h3><ul class="ss-list"><li>Ids, digests, repo paths, log lines, code.</li><li>Meta size (12 / 16), or 13 / 20 in the log viewer.</li><li>Never a costume: the tape digits use Schibsted with tabular figures.</li></ul><p class="pm-t-body"><span class="pm-mono">builder.job.finished</span> <span class="pm-mono">pramaan-build/todo-d509a2e9</span></p></div>
      <div class="ss-card"><h3>Digits, done right</h3><p class="ss-cap">Digits hold pure digits and a unit. A thousands comma goes in a Meta sentence under Details instead.</p><p class="pm-t-digits">27<span class="pm-t-body pm-muted"> %</span></p><p class="pm-meta">5,415,812 of 20,000,000 tokens</p></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Measure: reading columns stop at 68ch (about 720px at the Reading step).</span>
      <div class="ss-measure"><p class="pm-t-reading">Start each local day with unchecked tasks: checks clear at midnight on an open list, or when you next open the list, while your tasks and their order stay.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4. Shell and layout -->
<section class="ss-sec" id="layout" aria-labelledby="h-layout">
  <header class="pm-section-head pm-section-head--page ss-head"><h2 id="h-layout">Shell and layout grammar</h2><span class="pm-meta">SPEC C</span></header>
  <div class="ss-body">
    <p class="ss-lede">The shell is the same on every project screen: an ink rail, a sticky top bar that carries Back, the breadcrumb, the tape and the thread slot, then the 28px Nothing-is-lost strip. The main job starts within 140px of the top.</p>
    <pre class="ss-ascii" aria-label="The shell at 1142 by 732, rail expanded">x:0        248                                                       1142
+----------+------------------------------------------------------------+  y:0
| INK RAIL | TOP BAR (sticky, 56px, stitch bottom edge)                 |
| 248px    | [Back][Projects / todo / Documents]  [TAPE 360px]  [THREAD]|
|          +------------------------------------------------------------+  y:56
| wordmark | strip 28px: "Last saved 14:10 . Last accepted: brief, Tue" |  (project screens)
| [&lt;&gt;]     +------------------------------------------------------------+  y:84
| All proj |  pad 24                                                    |
| ------   |  h1 Documents                          (secondary actions) |  y:108
| T todo   |  sentence                                                  |
| ------   |  ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| Overview |  MAIN JOB (table / list / form / board) begins here, y&lt;=140|
| Interview|                                                            |
| Documents|                                                            |
| Roadmap  |                                                            |
| Build    |                                                            |
| Try it   |                                                            |
| Settings |                                                            |
| Live logs|                                                            |
| budget   |                                                            |
| user     |                                                            |
+----------+------------------------------------------------------------+  y:732</pre>
    <div>
      <h3 class="pm-t-heading">Layout archetypes</h3>
      <p class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Schematics: the ink strip is the rail, the yellow bar is where the one thread lives, the shaded block is the main job. Grey blocks are supporting panels. The first ten are the pass-1 archetypes; the last seven are pass 2 and replace the Overview and Task schematics on the screens listed under them.</p>
      <div class="ss-wires">
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-rows:12px 1fr"><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">List</p><p class="ss-cap">One column, search in the title row. <a href="screens/01-projects.html">01</a> <a href="screens/08-documents.html">08</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 34%;grid-template-rows:12px 22px 1fr"><div class="ss-blk" style="grid-column:1/-1"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job" style="grid-column:1/-1"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Overview</p><p class="ss-cap">Pass 1. Decision banner, then digits and what happens next. Now the bento below on 03, 04 and 19.</p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="padding-inline:22%"><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Task</p><p class="ss-cap">Pass 1, retired from every screen (Ruling 12). Forms use the task with aside below.</p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 34%"><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Chat workbench</p><p class="ss-cap">Thread, docked composer, decisions panel. <a href="screens/05-interview-running.html">05</a> <a href="screens/06-interview-finished.html">06</a> <a href="screens/07-interview-locked.html">07</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:22% 1fr 14%"><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--chalk"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Reading</p><p class="ss-cap">Contents, 68ch column, chalk margin. <a href="screens/09-document-draft.html">09</a> <a href="screens/10-document-locked.html">10</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-rows:14px 1fr 1fr;padding-inline:12%"><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Plan</p><p class="ss-cap">Pass 1. Approval gate, then the sprint route. Now the plan with aside below on 11, 11b, 12 and 14.</p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 30%;grid-template-rows:14px 1fr"><div class="ss-blk" style="grid-column:1/-1"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Board</p><p class="ss-cap">Sprint header, feature board, this sprint. Pass 2 moves 13 and 13b to the build archetype below; 14 is a plan with aside.</p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 34%"><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Stage</p><p class="ss-cap">Preview fills the viewport, checklist beside it. <a href="screens/15-try-it.html">15</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="padding-inline:16%;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr 1fr"><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Settings</p><p class="ss-cap">Pass 1. One 720px column of stacked forms. Now settings with aside on 16.</p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-rows:12px 1fr"><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Log</p><p class="ss-cap">Filter row, then the log list is the scroller. <a href="screens/17-live-logs.html">17</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 34%;padding-inline:10%"><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Task with aside</p><p class="ss-cap">Form 560px plus a fitted aside 320px, centred. <a href="screens/02-new-project.html">02</a> <a href="screens/18-handoff-source.html">18</a> <a href="screens/20-handoff-requirements.html">20</a> <a href="screens/21-repo-connect.html">21</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);grid-template-rows:12px 14px 1fr"><div class="ss-blk" style="grid-column:1/-1;background:var(--pm-sys-status-needs-you-tint)"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job" style="grid-column:span 2"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Bento overview</p><p class="ss-cap">Lead tile, three digits, next, info, in reading order. <a href="screens/03-overview-decision.html">03</a> <a href="screens/04-overview-paused.html">04</a> <a href="screens/19-handoff-copying.html">19</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 34%;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr 1fr"><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Settings with aside</p><p class="ss-cap">720px sections plus a sticky "This project" card. <a href="screens/16-settings.html">16</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 34%;grid-template-rows:12px 1fr"><div class="ss-blk" style="grid-column:1/-1"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Plan with aside</p><p class="ss-cap">Gate bar, route 760px, sticky "Plan at a glance". <a href="screens/11-roadmap-awaiting.html">11</a> <a href="screens/11b-roadmap-drafting.html">11b</a> <a href="screens/12-roadmap-approved.html">12</a> <a href="screens/14-sprints-accepted.html">14</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 30%;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr"><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job" style="grid-row:1/-1"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Build</p><p class="ss-cap">Sprint head and board, with "This sprint" and the feed beside it from 1000px. <a href="screens/13-sprints-building.html">13</a> <a href="screens/13b-sprints-blocked.html">13b</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-rows:22px 1fr;padding-inline:12%"><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Requests</p><p class="ss-cap">Composer, then the request list in rank order. <a href="screens/22-repo-requests.html">22</a> <a href="screens/22b-repo-requests-empty.html">22b</a></p></div>
        <div class="ss-wire-item"><div class="ss-wire"><div class="ss-wire-rail"></div><div class="ss-wire-col"><div class="ss-wire-bar"><i></i></div><div class="ss-wire-body" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 34%;grid-template-rows:14px 1fr 1fr"><div class="ss-blk" style="background:var(--pm-sys-status-needs-you-tint)"></div><div class="ss-blk"></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div></div><div class="ss-blk ss-blk--job"></div><div></div></div></div></div><p class="pm-t-label">Request</p><p class="ss-cap">Decision banner, what Pramaan did, what you asked, and "What stays with you". <a href="screens/23-repo-request.html">23</a> <a href="screens/23b-repo-request-blocked.html">23b</a></p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="pm-t-heading">The pass-2 archetypes and the fitted panel</h3>
      <div class="pm-table-scroll"><table class="pm-table ss-plain ss-wide"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Archetype</th><th scope="col">Screens</th><th scope="col">Grid</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Task with aside</strong> <span class="pm-mono">.pm-arch-task2</span></td><td><a href="screens/02-new-project.html">02</a>, <a href="screens/18-handoff-source.html">18</a>, <a href="screens/18b-handoff-github.html">18b</a>, <a href="screens/18c-handoff-too-big.html">18c</a>, <a href="screens/18d-handoff-not-zip.html">18d</a>, <a href="screens/18e-handoff-github-permission.html">18e</a>, <a href="screens/20-handoff-requirements.html">20</a>, <a href="screens/21-repo-connect.html">21</a>, <a href="screens/21b-repo-connect-permission.html">21b</a>, <a href="screens/21c-repo-connect-empty.html">21c</a></td><td>Form 420 to 560px plus the fitted aside at the panel width (320, 360 from 1440), centred. One column below 900px of content.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Bento overview</strong> <span class="pm-mono">.pm-bento</span></td><td><a href="screens/03-overview-decision.html">03</a>, <a href="screens/04-overview-paused.html">04</a>, <a href="screens/19-handoff-copying.html">19</a></td><td>Three equal columns, 20px gap. The lead tile spans all three; the digit tiles sit in one row; "What happens next" spans two. One column below 800px. No <span class="pm-mono">order</span> property anywhere.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Settings with aside</strong> <span class="pm-mono">.pm-arch-settings2</span></td><td><a href="screens/16-settings.html">16</a></td><td>720px sections plus a sticky fitted aside (280px from 800 to 899px of content).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Plan with aside</strong> <span class="pm-mono">.pm-arch-plan2</span></td><td><a href="screens/11-roadmap-awaiting.html">11</a>, <a href="screens/11b-roadmap-drafting.html">11b</a>, <a href="screens/12-roadmap-approved.html">12</a>, <a href="screens/14-sprints-accepted.html">14</a></td><td>Route 760px plus the aside. The gate bar stays full width and sticky above the grid; the aside sticks under it.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Build</strong> <span class="pm-mono">.pm-arch-build</span></td><td><a href="screens/13-sprints-building.html">13</a>, <a href="screens/13b-sprints-blocked.html">13b</a></td><td>One column; from a content box of 1000px a container query gives <span class="pm-mono">minmax(0, 1fr) 320px</span>, so "This sprint" and the feed sit beside the sprint head at both viewports.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Requests</strong> <span class="pm-mono">.pm-arch-list</span> and the request composer</td><td><a href="screens/22-repo-requests.html">22</a>, <a href="screens/22b-repo-requests-empty.html">22b</a></td><td>One column: the composer, then the request list in rank order.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Request</strong> <span class="pm-mono">.pm-arch-request</span></td><td><a href="screens/23-repo-request.html">23</a>, <a href="screens/23b-repo-request-blocked.html">23b</a></td><td>720px main column plus the fitted aside "What stays with you".</td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
      <p class="ss-lede" style="margin-top:var(--pm-space-3)"><strong>The fitted panel</strong> (<span class="pm-mono">.pm-panel--fit</span>, Ruling 10). A side panel is never taller than its content: it has content height, a hairline border, the card radius, and on page screens it sticks under the top bar (<span class="pm-mono">.pm-panel--sticky</span>). The ground under it is breathing room, which is why Law 6 allowlists the column below a fitted panel and the contents rail. Its maximum height is the viewport minus the bar, the strip and 40px, and it scrolls only if its content is longer than that. The full-height edge-to-edge panel survives only where its content fills it: the log list and the reader.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="pm-t-heading" id="screens">All 34 screens</h3>
      <p class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Each thumbnail is a screenshot taken by the shoot tool at 1142 by 732. Open a screen to use it. The founder journey is 20 screens (01 to 17 with the 05b, 11b and 13b states); Lane A and Lane B add seven each.</p>
      <h4 class="pm-t-label">The founder journey</h4>
      <ul class="ss-thumbs">
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/01-projects.html"><img src="shots/01-projects-1142x732.png" alt="Projects list" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">01 Projects</strong><span class="pm-meta">List</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/02-new-project.html"><img src="shots/02-new-project-1142x732.png" alt="New project form" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">02 New project</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/03-overview-decision.html"><img src="shots/03-overview-decision-1142x732.png" alt="Overview, decision needed" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">03 Overview, decision</strong><span class="pm-meta">Bento overview</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/04-overview-paused.html"><img src="shots/04-overview-paused-1142x732.png" alt="Overview, paused" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">04 Overview, paused</strong><span class="pm-meta">Bento overview</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/05-interview-running.html"><img src="shots/05-interview-running-1142x732.png" alt="Interview running" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">05 Interview running</strong><span class="pm-meta">Chat workbench</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/05b-interview-empty.html"><img src="shots/05b-interview-empty-1142x732.png" alt="Interview just started" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">05b Interview, empty</strong><span class="pm-meta">Chat workbench, empty</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/06-interview-finished.html"><img src="shots/06-interview-finished-1142x732.png" alt="Interview finished" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">06 Interview finished</strong><span class="pm-meta">Chat workbench</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/07-interview-locked.html"><img src="shots/07-interview-locked-1142x732.png" alt="Interview locked" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">07 Interview locked</strong><span class="pm-meta">Chat workbench, locked</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/08-documents.html"><img src="shots/08-documents-1142x732.png" alt="Documents list" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">08 Documents</strong><span class="pm-meta">List</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/09-document-draft.html"><img src="shots/09-document-draft-1142x732.png" alt="Product brief draft" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">09 Document draft</strong><span class="pm-meta">Reading</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/10-document-locked.html"><img src="shots/10-document-locked-1142x732.png" alt="Product brief locked" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">10 Document locked</strong><span class="pm-meta">Reading, locked</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/11-roadmap-awaiting.html"><img src="shots/11-roadmap-awaiting-1142x732.png" alt="Roadmap awaiting approval" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">11 Roadmap, awaiting</strong><span class="pm-meta">Plan with aside</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/11b-roadmap-drafting.html"><img src="shots/11b-roadmap-drafting-1142x732.png" alt="Roadmap being drafted" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">11b Roadmap, drafting</strong><span class="pm-meta">Plan with aside, working</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/12-roadmap-approved.html"><img src="shots/12-roadmap-approved-1142x732.png" alt="Roadmap approved" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">12 Roadmap, approved</strong><span class="pm-meta">Plan with aside</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/13-sprints-building.html"><img src="shots/13-sprints-building-1142x732.png" alt="Sprint building" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">13 Sprint building</strong><span class="pm-meta">Build</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/13b-sprints-blocked.html"><img src="shots/13b-sprints-blocked-1142x732.png" alt="Sprint with a failed check" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">13b Sprint, blocked</strong><span class="pm-meta">Build, blocked</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/14-sprints-accepted.html"><img src="shots/14-sprints-accepted-1142x732.png" alt="All sprints accepted" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">14 Sprints accepted</strong><span class="pm-meta">Plan with aside</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/15-try-it.html"><img src="shots/15-try-it-1142x732.png" alt="Try it" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">15 Try it</strong><span class="pm-meta">Stage</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/16-settings.html"><img src="shots/16-settings-1142x732.png" alt="Settings" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">16 Settings</strong><span class="pm-meta">Settings with aside</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/17-live-logs.html"><img src="shots/17-live-logs-1142x732.png" alt="Live logs" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">17 Live logs</strong><span class="pm-meta">Log</span></a></li>
      </ul>
      <h4 class="pm-t-label" style="margin-top:var(--pm-space-5)">Lane A: hand off your code</h4>
      <p class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">For a founder who already has code. Pramaan reads it once, builds in its own private copy, and never writes back to where the code came from.</p>
      <ul class="ss-thumbs">
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/18-handoff-source.html"><img src="shots/18-handoff-source-1142x732.png" alt="Hand off your code, upload a .zip" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">18 Hand off your code</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/18b-handoff-github.html"><img src="shots/18b-handoff-github-1142x732.png" alt="Hand off your code, import from GitHub" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">18b From GitHub</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/18c-handoff-too-big.html"><img src="shots/18c-handoff-too-big-1142x732.png" alt="Hand off your code, file too big" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">18c File too big</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside, blocked</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/18d-handoff-not-zip.html"><img src="shots/18d-handoff-not-zip-1142x732.png" alt="Hand off your code, not a .zip" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">18d Not a .zip</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside, blocked</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/18e-handoff-github-permission.html"><img src="shots/18e-handoff-github-permission-1142x732.png" alt="Hand off your code, GitHub needs permission" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">18e GitHub permission</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside, needs you</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/19-handoff-copying.html"><img src="shots/19-handoff-copying-1142x732.png" alt="Customer portal overview while the private copy is made" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">19 Copying your code</strong><span class="pm-meta">Bento, working</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/20-handoff-requirements.html"><img src="shots/20-handoff-requirements-1142x732.png" alt="Customer portal, bring a requirements document" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">20 Your requirements</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside</span></a></li>
      </ul>
      <h4 class="pm-t-label" style="margin-top:var(--pm-space-5)">Lane B: work in my repository</h4>
      <p class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">For an engineering team. Pramaan opens reviewed pull requests in a repository you own and never pushes to your default branch.</p>
      <ul class="ss-thumbs">
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/21-repo-connect.html"><img src="shots/21-repo-connect-1142x732.png" alt="Work in your repository, choose a repository" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">21 Connect repository</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/21b-repo-connect-permission.html"><img src="shots/21b-repo-connect-permission-1142x732.png" alt="Work in your repository, GitHub App not installed" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">21b App not installed</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside, blocked</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/21c-repo-connect-empty.html"><img src="shots/21c-repo-connect-empty-1142x732.png" alt="Work in your repository, no repositories found" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">21c None found</strong><span class="pm-meta">Task with aside, empty</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/22-repo-requests.html"><img src="shots/22-repo-requests-1142x732.png" alt="Requests for insight-weaver-537" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">22 Requests</strong><span class="pm-meta">Requests</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/22b-repo-requests-empty.html"><img src="shots/22b-repo-requests-empty-1142x732.png" alt="Requests, none yet" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">22b None yet</strong><span class="pm-meta">Requests, empty</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/23-repo-request.html"><img src="shots/23-repo-request-1142x732.png" alt="A request that is ready to merge" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">23 Ready to merge</strong><span class="pm-meta">Request, needs you</span></a></li>
        <li><a class="ss-thumb" href="screens/23b-repo-request-blocked.html"><img src="shots/23b-repo-request-blocked-1142x732.png" alt="A request whose check did not pass" loading="lazy"><strong class="pm-t-label">23b Check failed</strong><span class="pm-meta">Request, blocked</span></a></li>
      </ul>
